    "title": "Moonlight Bike Ride - Friday August 15 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "kgloam.com\nwebsite\nMason City\nMoonlight Bike Ride – Friday August 15\n13 hours ago\nGet ready to glow and go at one of Mason City’s favorite summer traditions! The Moonlight Bike Ride returns Friday, August 15, 2025, for an unforgettable night of fun, fitness, and community spirit. Meet at the River City Riverwalk, just south of the Southbridge Mall parking lot, for an 8-mile ride under the moonlight. Whether you’re a seasoned cyclist or just out for a leisurely cruise, this evening ride is open to all ages and skill levels.",
